      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i think something is wrong with my smart home setup. my lights keep shifting to a slightly warmer hue at like 2am exactly and the thermostat drops 3 degrees every tuesday night right when i'm about to fall asleep. it feels way too consistent to just be a glitch or a schedule. i'm worried someone might have remote access to my hub. can u help me figure out if there's a pattern here that looks like someone is messing with me?",
